(6860184, 1032180, 60862, '<td valign="top">Belongs on a museum wall in an exhibit called "Together."  This is a great example of how composition and contrast makes the point about buddies without being so literal.</td>', 'Belongs on a museum wall in an exhibit called "Together."  This is a great example of how composition and contrast makes the point about buddies without being so literal.', '2012-09-08 15:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
