(6860189, 1032530, 60862, '<td valign="top">Another one that belongs in a museum exhibit titled "Together."  I just wish they were a little more into the frame.  Also, do you know about rear curtain flash?  It makes the flash go off at the end of a slow shutter so the brightly lit frozen subject is at the end of the blur instead of the beginning.  Not sure it matters here, and if you chose to do it this way, then good for you.  But if you don''t know about it, I encourage you to experiment.  Just another tool in the toolbox!</td>', 'Another one that belongs in a museum exhibit titled "Together."  I just wish they were a little more into the frame.  Also, do you know about rear curtain flash?  It makes the flash go off at the end of a slow shutter so the brightly lit frozen subject is at the end of the blur instead of the beginning.  Not sure it matters here, and if you chose to do it this way, then good for you.  But if you don''t know about it, I encourage you to experiment.  Just another tool in the toolbox!', '2012-09-08 15:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
