(6860991, 1032867, 142363, '<td valign="top">My top three - it feels a little over-processed, but that might be my complete newbie eye.  Still - it''s a glorious moment captured - and the focus is fantastic.  Just made me happy to look at - and I kept coming back to it while reviewing the pictures as an absolute favorite.</td>', 'My top three - it feels a little over-processed, but that might be my complete newbie eye.  Still - it''s a glorious moment captured - and the focus is fantastic.  Just made me happy to look at - and I kept coming back to it while reviewing the pictures as an absolute favorite.', '2012-09-10 09:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
