(6862381, 1032906, 144365, '<td valign="top">#3, tied with another<br/>I''m not normally one to vote on the cute factor of a photo, but this was an exception. The fact they''re both sleeping, or dead, gives it that somber look which added to the mood. If they''re eyes were open I might have voted this a little lower because it would provoke as strong an emotional reaction.</td>', '#3, tied with anotherI''m not normally one to vote on the cute factor of a photo, but this was an exception. The fact they''re both sleeping, or dead, gives it that somber look which added to the mood. If they''re eyes were open I might have voted this a little lower because it would provoke as strong an emotional reaction.', '2012-09-12 13:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
