(6862815, 1032832, 12611, '<td valign="top">I like the tones a lot, and the light is beautiful, focus spot on. The pinks and burnished orange yellows are terrific.  Compositionally, my untrained eye thinks that dropping or raising the horizon would have given it more emotional impact,(less or more road might work) and the road falls off to the left, pulling my eye to the crappy scrub brush side. (7 for me thinking about it this much!)</td>', 'I like the tones a lot, and the light is beautiful, focus spot on. The pinks and burnished orange yellows are terrific.  Compositionally, my untrained eye thinks that dropping or raising the horizon would have given it more emotional impact,(less or more road might work) and the road falls off to the left, pulling my eye to the crappy scrub brush side. (7 for me thinking about it this much!)', '2012-09-13 10:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
